squareSeven in main
squareSeven invokes square
squareSeven argument value Int64 seven copy
squareSeven result squared Int64
squareSeven ownedBy none
squareSeven cleanedBy none
squareSeven borrows none
squareSeven catch none
squareSeven suppresses none

