factorialTen in main
factorialTen invokes factorial
factorialTen argument n Int64 ten copy
factorialTen result factored Int64
factorialTen ownedBy none
factorialTen cleanedBy none
factorialTen borrows none
factorialTen catch none
factorialTen suppresses none

